# SOT-223: three gull-wing leads and a wide tab. A per-pin lead line sizes pin 4's land and 3D lead.

footprint "SOT-223"
  description: "SOT-223 (JEDEC TO-261AA): 3 leads + tab lead, 2.3 mm pitch"
  refdes: "U"
  tags: regulator, sot

  body 6.5 x 3.5 x 1.8              # D x E1 x A
  pins
    bottom: 1, 2, 3 pitch: 2.3      # pin 1 bottom left
    top: 4                          # the tab, opposite pin 2
  end
  lead gullwing 0.7 x 0.9 span: 7.0  # b x L, span E (tip to tip)
  lead 4 gullwing 3.0 x 0.9         # b2: the tab is 3 mm wide
  pin1: dot
end
